      "review_description": "Look no further!!! Matt from Curran-T Electrical & Solar and his team installed our new solar system at our house on the central coast. They did an amazing job. Right from the start I could not fault their experience, from the initial time we met to the after sales service. Matt was prompt and efficient and Matt and his team did a great job tiding up after themselves. Matt went through our current energy requirements and asked about our vehicles which I wasn’t expecting. He explained that this was needed to design the right system for our needs now and into the future. We now have a sub board and inverter in our garage which we can easily add a battery and EV charger to when we get our new car. We couldn’t be happier with Matt and his team and will be using CES (Curran-T Electrical & Solar) for our upcoming renovations. All in all great advice and great to deal with. Our Solar system is working great, thank you to the CES team.",
